1
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:09,375
Sauron, the enemy of the Free Peoples
of Middle-earth, was defeated.

2
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,750
But the hearts of Men are easily corrupted,

3
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:20,583
and the Ring of Power has a will of its own.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,375
History became legend. Legend became myth.

5
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:34,792
And for two and a half thousand years,
the Ring passed out of all knowledge,

6
00:00:34,875 --> 00:00:39,000
until, when chance came,

7
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:42,375
it ensnared a new bearer.

8
00:00:44,375 --> 00:00:47,000
My precious.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,708
The Ring came to the creature Gollum,

10
00:00:51,792 --> 00:00:56,167
who took it deep into the
tunnels of the Misty Mountains.

11
00:00:57,583 --> 00:01:02,292
But something happened then
the Ring did not intend.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,875
On the 22nd day of
September in the year 1400,

13
00:01:12,375 --> 00:01:14,833
by Shire Reckoning.

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,083
Bag End, Bagshot Row,
Hobbiton, Westfarthing,

15
00:01:21,292 --> 00:01:23,292
the Shire,

16
00:01:23,417 --> 00:01:25,875
Middle-earth,

17
00:01:30,667 --> 00:01:33,792
the Third Age of this world.
